{"seq":2,"slug":"hash-and-bitmap","title":"哈希与位图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/hash-and-bitmap","wordCount":786,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"哈希与位图索引\">哈希与位图索引</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>除了 B+ 树索引，数据库还提供了多种专用索引类型，针对不同的查询模式进行优化。哈希索引擅长等值查询，位图索引适合低基数列，全文索引处理文本搜索，空间索引支持地理数据查询。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>擅长场景</th>\n<th>不适合场景</th>\n<th>典型数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希索引</td>\n<td>等值查询</td>\n<td>范围查询</td>\n<td>MySQL Memory、Redis</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位图索引</td>\n<td>低基数列</td>\n<td>高并发写入</td>\n<td>Oracle、PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全文索引</td>\n<td>文本搜索</td>\n<td>精确匹配</td>\n<td>MySQL、PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GiST</td>\n<td>范围/空间查询</td>\n<td>简单等值查询</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GIN</td>\n<td>多值/全文索引</td>\n<td>频繁更新</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间索引</td>\n<td>地理位置查询</td>\n<td>非空间数据</td>\n<td>MySQL、PostGIS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"哈希索引\">哈希索引</h2><p>哈希索引通过哈希函数将键值映射到哈希桶，实现 O(1) 的等值查找。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    K1[&quot;key: &#39;alice&#39;&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;Hash()&quot;] --&gt; B1[&quot;Bucket 3 → 行指针&quot;]&#10;    K2[&quot;key: &#39;bob&#39;&quot;] --&gt; H2[&quot;Hash()&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;Bucket 7 → 行指针&quot;]&#10;    K3[&quot;key: &#39;carol&#39;&quot;] --&gt; H3[&quot;Hash()&quot;] --&gt; B3[&quot;Bucket 1 → 行指针&quot;]\">graph LR\n    K1[\"key: 'alice'\"] --&gt; H[\"Hash()\"] --&gt; B1[\"Bucket 3 → 行指针\"]\n    K2[\"key: 'bob'\"] --&gt; H2[\"Hash()\"] --&gt; B2[\"Bucket 7 → 行指针\"]\n    K3[\"key: 'carol'\"] --&gt; H3[\"Hash()\"] --&gt; B3[\"Bucket 1 → 行指针\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>哈希索引</th>\n<th>B+ 树索引</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等值查询</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查询</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>O(log n + k)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀匹配</td>\n<td>❌ 不支持</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间占用</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostgreSQL：创建哈希索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_hash_email ON users USING hash (email);&#10;&#10;-- 适用场景：精确匹配&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = &#39;alice@example.com&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 不适用：范围查询（哈希索引无效）&#10;SELECT * FROM users WHERE email &gt; &#39;a%&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：创建哈希索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_hash_email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (email);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 适用场景：精确匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'alice@example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不适用：范围查询（哈希索引无效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> email </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'a%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"哈希冲突处理\">哈希冲突处理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>链地址法</td>\n<td>同一桶中用链表存储冲突元素</td>\n<td>简单，但链表过长退化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开放寻址法</td>\n<td>冲突时探测下一个空闲槽</td>\n<td>节省空间，但删除复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可扩展哈希</td>\n<td>动态调整桶数量</td>\n<td>适合数据库场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"位图索引\">位图索引</h2><p>位图索引为每个不同的值维护一个位向量，每个 bit 对应表中的一行。特别适合低基数列（如性别、状态）和数据仓库场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"status 列有三个值：active, inactive, banned&#10;&#10;active:   1 0 1 1 0 0 1 0&#10;inactive: 0 1 0 0 1 0 0 1&#10;banned:   0 0 0 0 0 1 0 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>status 列有三个值：active, inactive, banned</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>active:   1 0 1 1 0 0 1 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>inactive: 0 1 0 0 1 0 0 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>banned:   0 0 0 0 0 1 0 0</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Oracle 创建位图索引&#10;CREATE BITMAP INDEX idx_bmp_status ON orders(status);&#10;CREATE BITMAP INDEX idx_bmp_region ON orders(region);&#10;&#10;-- 位图索引的优势：多条件 AND/OR 可直接做位运算&#10;SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders&#10;WHERE status = &#39;active&#39; AND region = &#39;east&#39;;&#10;-- active 位图 AND east 位图 → 快速得到结果\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Oracle 创建位图索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BITMAP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_bmp_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BITMAP </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_bmp_region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(region);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 位图索引的优势：多条件 AND/OR 可直接做位运算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'east'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- active 位图 AND east 位图 → 快速得到结果</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>不适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据仓库 OLAP</td>\n<td>OLTP 高并发写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低基数列（&lt;100）</td>\n<td>高基数列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量 AND/OR 查询</td>\n<td>频繁 UPDATE/DELETE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量加载后查询</td>\n<td>实时事务处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"全文索引\">全文索引</h2><p>全文索引专门用于文本搜索，支持分词、相关性排序和模糊匹配。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- MySQL：创建全文索引&#10;CREATE FULLTEXT INDEX idx_ft_content ON articles(title, content);&#10;&#10;SELECT * FROM articles&#10;WHERE MATCH(title, content) AGAINST(&#39;数据库 优化&#39; IN NATURAL LANGUAGE MODE);&#10;&#10;-- PostgreSQL：使用 tsvector 和 tsquery&#10;ALTER TABLE articles ADD COLUMN search_vector tsvector;&#10;&#10;UPDATE articles SET search_vector =&#10;    to_tsvector(&#39;chinese&#39;, title || &#39; &#39; || content);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_gin_search ON articles USING gin(search_vector);&#10;&#10;SELECT title, ts_rank(search_vector, query) AS rank&#10;FROM articles, to_tsquery(&#39;chinese&#39;, &#39;数据库 &amp; 优化&#39;) query&#10;WHERE search_vector @@ query&#10;ORDER BY rank DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL：创建全文索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FULLTEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_ft_content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles(title, content);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> MATCH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(title, content) AGAINST(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据库 优化'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NATURAL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MODE);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：使用 tsvector 和 tsquery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> COLUMN search_vector tsvector;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_vector </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    to_tsvector(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chinese'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, title </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ' '</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> content);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_gin_search</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gin(search_vector);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> title, ts_rank(search_vector, query) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles, to_tsquery(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chinese'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据库 &#x26; 优化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_vector @@ query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rank </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>全文搜索模式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>MySQL 语法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NATURAL LANGUAGE</td>\n<td>自然语言模式，自动相关性排序</td>\n<td>IN NATURAL LANGUAGE MODE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BOOLEAN</td>\n<td>布尔模式，支持 +/- 操作符</td>\n<td>IN BOOLEAN MODE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QUERY EXPANSION</td>\n<td>查询扩展，自动关联词</td>\n<td>WITH QUERY EXPANSION</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gist-与-gin-索引\">GiST 与 GIN 索引</h2><p>PostgreSQL 提供的两种通用索引框架，支持复杂数据类型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>适用数据类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GiST</td>\n<td>Generalized Search Tree</td>\n<td>范围类型、几何、全文</td>\n<td>有损，支持最近邻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GIN</td>\n<td>Generalized Inverted Index</td>\n<td>数组、JSONB、全文</td>\n<td>精确，查找快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- GIN 索引：JSONB 查询&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_gin_data ON events USING gin(metadata);&#10;&#10;SELECT * FROM events WHERE metadata @&gt; &#39;{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;click&quot;}&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- GIN 索引：数组包含查询&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_gin_tags ON articles USING gin(tags);&#10;&#10;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE tags @&gt; ARRAY[&#39;database&#39;, &#39;index&#39;];&#10;&#10;-- GiST 索引：范围查询&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_gist_range ON reservations USING gist(during);&#10;&#10;SELECT * FROM reservations WHERE during &amp;&amp; &#39;[2024-01-01, 2024-01-31]&#39;::daterange;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- GIN 索引：JSONB 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_gin_data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gin(metadata);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metadata @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"type\": \"click\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- GIN 索引：数组包含查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_gin_tags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gin(tags);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> articles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tags @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">['database', 'index'];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- GiST 索引：范围查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_gist_range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reservations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gist(during);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reservations </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> during &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[2024-01-01, 2024-01-31]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::daterange;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"空间索引\">空间索引</h2><p>空间索引基于 R 树结构，支持地理位置和几何图形的高效查询。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostGIS 空间索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_gist_location ON stores USING gist(location);&#10;&#10;-- 查找 5 公里内的商店&#10;SELECT name, ST_Distance(location, ST_MakePoint(116.40, 39.90)::geography) AS dist&#10;FROM stores&#10;WHERE ST_DWithin(location, ST_MakePoint(116.40, 39.90)::geography, 5000)&#10;ORDER BY dist;&#10;&#10;-- MySQL 空间索引&#10;CREATE SPATIAL INDEX idx_spatial ON stores(location);&#10;&#10;SELECT name FROM stores&#10;WHERE ST_Distance_Sphere(location, POINT(116.40, 39.90)) &lt; 5000;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostGIS 空间索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_gist_location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gist(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查找 5 公里内的商店</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ST_Distance(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ST_MakePoint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">116</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">geography</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stores</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ST_DWithin(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ST_MakePoint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">116</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">geography</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL 空间索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SPATIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_spatial </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stores(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stores</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ST_Distance_Sphere(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">location</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">POINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">116</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">39</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"索引类型选择指南\">索引类型选择指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{查询类型?} --&gt;|等值查询| B{基数高?}&#10;    A --&gt;|范围查询| C[B+ 树索引]&#10;    A --&gt;|文本搜索| D[全文索引 GIN]&#10;    A --&gt;|地理位置| E[空间索引 GiST]&#10;    A --&gt;|JSON/数组| F[GIN 索引]&#10;    B --&gt;|高| G[B+ 树或哈希]&#10;    B --&gt;|低| H[位图索引]\">graph TD\n    A{查询类型?} --&gt;|等值查询| B{基数高?}\n    A --&gt;|范围查询| C[B+ 树索引]\n    A --&gt;|文本搜索| D[全文索引 GIN]\n    A --&gt;|地理位置| E[空间索引 GiST]\n    A --&gt;|JSON/数组| F[GIN 索引]\n    B --&gt;|高| G[B+ 树或哈希]\n    B --&gt;|低| H[位图索引]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((索引类型))&#10;    哈希索引&#10;      O&amp;#40;1&amp;#41; 等值查找&#10;      不支持范围&#10;    位图索引&#10;      低基数列&#10;      位运算加速&#10;      OLAP 场景&#10;    全文索引&#10;      分词搜索&#10;      相关性排序&#10;    GiST / GIN&#10;      复杂数据类型&#10;      JSONB / 数组&#10;    空间索引&#10;      R 树&#10;      地理位置\">mindmap\n  root((索引类型))\n    哈希索引\n      O&amp;#40;1&amp;#41; 等值查找\n      不支持范围\n    位图索引\n      低基数列\n      位运算加速\n      OLAP 场景\n    全文索引\n      分词搜索\n      相关性排序\n    GiST / GIN\n      复杂数据类型\n      JSONB / 数组\n    空间索引\n      R 树\n      地理位置</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>哈希索引</strong>的等值查询是 O(1)，但不支持范围查询和排序。</li>\n<li><strong>位图索引</strong>通过位运算加速多条件组合查询，适合 OLAP 场景的低基数列。</li>\n<li><strong>全文索引</strong>支持分词和相关性排序，是文本搜索的标准方案。</li>\n<li><strong>GIN 索引</strong>适合 JSONB、数组和全文搜索，<strong>GiST</strong> 适合范围和空间数据。</li>\n<li>索引选择应根据<strong>查询模式和数据特征</strong>决定，没有万能索引。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"哈希与位图索引","id":"哈希与位图索引"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希索引","id":"哈希索引"},{"level":3,"text":"哈希冲突处理","id":"哈希冲突处理"},{"level":2,"text":"位图索引","id":"位图索引"},{"level":2,"text":"全文索引","id":"全文索引"},{"level":2,"text":"GiST 与 GIN 索引","id":"gist-与-gin-索引"},{"level":2,"text":"空间索引","id":"空间索引"},{"level":2,"text":"索引类型选择指南","id":"索引类型选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"B 树索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/b-tree-indexes"},"next":{"title":"存储引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/indexing-and-storage/storage-engines"}}